<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan Oct consumer prices up 11.03 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Pakistan Oct consumer prices up 11.03 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>ISLAMABAD 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan's consumer price index rose 11.03 percent in October year-on-year compared with 9.83 percent in September and 10.84 percent in October 1995, the Federal Bureau of Statistics said on Monday.</p>
<p>The index rose 1.20 percent to 184.17 in October after rising 1.16 percent in September to 181.99. The index stood at 165.88 in October 1995.</p>
<p>					  Oct	Sept	   Oct 1995</p>
<p>CONSUMER PRICE  base 1990/91   184.17    181.99	 165.88</p>
<p>    Month-on-month		  +1.20    +1.16	   +0.11</p>
<p>    Year-on-year		   +11.03    +9.83	  +10.84</p>
<p>-- Islamabad newsroom 9251-274757</p>
</text>
